OL,3,GNEWSAFire-ravaged former pub to undergo
OL,4,Afull repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former pub building where a cannabis
OL,7,Ffactory was discovered following a
OL,8,Flarge fire is to undergo repairs, after
OL,9,Fofficials approved a series of works.
OL,11,FThe blaze broke out at the former Cat
OL,12,Fand Fiddle pub on Magdalen Street in
OL,13,FNorwich last year, which in recent
OL,14,Ftimes had been turned into flats.
OL,16,FNo arrests were made following the
OL,17,Fblaze and the criminal investigation
OL,18,Fhas since been closed by Norfolk
OL,19,FPolice.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
