OL,3,GNEWSAFire-ravaged former pub to undergo
OL,4,Afull repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe building's owner, Jonathan Thursby,
OL,7,Fthe chief executive of nearby music
OL,8,Fvenue Epic Studios, has been granted
OL,9,Fpermission by Norwich City Council to
OL,10,Frectify the damage, including replacing
OL,11,Fthe roof spaces.
